---
import Chart from "../Chart.astro";
import Choice from "../Choice.astro";
import Source from "../Source.astro";
import { text, type Lang } from "../../data";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = (z: string, e: string) => text(lang, z, e);
---

<Chart
  kind="effects"
  title={t("任务中的变化，可以被测量", "Measurable changes in specific tasks")}
  description={t(
    "各研究基准 = 100；选择指标，比较同一研究内的变化。",
    "Baseline = 100 within each study. Select an outcome for a within-study comparison.",
  )}
  ids={["nber", "writing"]}
  records={["support", "time", "quality"]}
  note={t(
    "指数由报告的相对变化换算。各研究的基准、样本和结果不同，不能按指数排名或求平均。",
    "Indices are derived from reported relative changes. Different studies and outcomes cannot be ranked or averaged together.",
  )}
>
  <div class="chart-controls">
    <Choice
      control="effect"
      label={t("研究指标", "Study outcome")}
      options={[
        { value: "support", label: t("客服效率", "Support") },
        { value: "time", label: t("写作耗时", "Writing time") },
        { value: "quality", label: t("写作质量", "Writing quality") },
      ]}
    />
  </div>
</Chart>
<div class="two-col">
  <Chart
    kind="developers"
    title={t(
      "不同工作现场，结果为何不同？",
      "Why do results differ across workplaces?",
    )}
    description={t(
      "两项独立研究 · 任务数量与任务耗时分别比较",
      "Two independent studies · task counts and time compared separately",
    )}
    ids={["developers", "metr", "metr26"]}
    records={["dev-tasks", "dev-time"]}
    note={t(
      "METR 2026 后续实验受选择偏差与计时问题影响，不能据早期结果判断当前工具。标准误不等于置信区间。",
      "METR’s 2026 follow-up has selection and timing issues; early results do not describe current tools. Standard error is not a confidence interval.",
    )}
  />
  <article class="editorial-card">
    <p class="hw-kicker">WHAT THIS MEANS</p>
    <h2>{t("收益需要什么条件？", "What makes gains possible?")}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "AI 辅助可能帮助经验较少的员工调用已有知识。效果取决于任务、工具与工作环境。",
        "AI assistance can help less experienced workers access existing knowledge. Effects depend on tasks, tools, and context.",
      )}
    </p>
    <div class="quote-note">
      {t(
        "一个客服样本的收益，不是所有岗位的未来。",
        "One support sample does not predict the future of every job.",
      )}
    </div>
    <h3>
      {t(
        "任务、经验、复核与组织",
        "Tasks, experience, review and organization",
      )}
    </h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        {t(
          "测量的是时间、数量，还是质量？",
          "Does it measure time, quantity, or quality?",
        )}
      </li>
      <li>{t("对谁有效，在哪种任务里？", "For whom, and in which tasks?")}</li>
      <li>
        {t(
          "复核与学习成本是否被计入？",
          "Are review and learning costs included?",
        )}
      </li>
      <li>
        {t(
          "组织是否允许把节省的时间转成有效产出？",
          "Can the organization turn saved time into useful output?",
        )}
      </li>
    </ul>
    <Source ids={["nber", "developers", "metr26"]} />
  </article>
</div>
